const noChapterOverride=/\b(?:mock (?:exam|test)|past (?:exam|test)|start (?:a |the )?(?:exam|quiz)|quiz me|test me|pdf|download|handout|syllabus|homework answer key)\b/;
const genericCheck=/^(?:can you |please )?(?:give me |show me |try )?(?:a )?(?:(?:quick|chapter|practice|self) )?check(?: my understanding)?$/;
const genericAnswer=/^(?:i (?:think|got|chose|picked|would|believe)|my (?:guess|answer)|show(?: me)?(?: the)? (?:answer|solution)|check my answer|(?:what is|whats) the answer|explain the answer|tell me the answer)\b/;
const genericSimplify=/^(?:can you |please )?(?:i (?:dont|don t) (?:get it|understand)|why|what does that mean|explain (?:that|it|this)(?: again| in simpler words| more simply)?|break (?:that|it|this) down|(?:show me|give me) (?:an|the) example)$/;

export function createBiologyChapterCoach(){
  let active=null,selectedEdition=null,checking=false;
  function reset(){
    active=null;
    selectedEdition=null;
    checking=false;
  }
  function remember(row){
    active=row;
    selectedEdition=row.book;
    checking=false;
    return lesson(row);
  }
  function respond(raw,selectedCourse=''){
    const query=tidy(raw??'');
    const courseText=tidy(selectedCourse);
    if(!query||/\bchem\b/.test(query)||/^chem/.test(courseText)||noChapterOverride.test(query)){
      reset();
      return null;
    }
    if(/^(?:new (?:topic|question|problem)|start over)\b/.test(query)){
      reset();
      return null;
    }
    const hintedBook=matchBook(query);
    const book=hintedBook??selectedEdition;
    const course=query.match(/\b(?:biol|biology|bio) ?(1406|1407)\b/)?.[1]??courseText.match(/\b(1406|1407)\b/)?.[1];
    const numberText=query.match(/\b(?:chapter|ch) ?(\d{1,3})\b/)?.[1];
    const unitText=query.match(/\bunit ?(\d)\b/)?.[1];
    if(hintedBook&&asksOtherEdition(query,hintedBook)&&(numberText||/\bchapters?\b/.test(query))){
      return {topic:'biology-chapters',intent:'clarify',text:'The numbered guide here uses '+editions[hintedBook]+'. Share the chapter title from your edition and I can match the topic.',links:guidanceLinks};
    }
    if(unitText&&course&&!numberText)return unitReply(course,Number(unitText)-1);
    if(numberText){
      if(!book&&!course&&Number(numberText)<=18&&!/\bbiolog\w*\b/.test(query))return null;
      const rows=chapterCandidates(query,Number(numberText),book);
      if(rows.length===1)return remember(rows[0]);
      if(rows.length>1)return choose(rows);
      return {topic:'biology-chapters',intent:'clarify',
        text:(book?editions[book]+' has chapters 1–'+books[book].size+'.':'The available guides have OpenStax chapters 1–47 and Campbell chapters 1–56.')+' Which topic are you studying?',
        links:guidanceLinks,actions:Object.keys(editions).map(editionAction)};
    }
    if(/\bchapters?\b/.test(query)&&/\b(?:which|what chapter|find|chapter for|chapter on|chapter about)\b/.test(query)){
      const rows=chapterForTopic(query,book);
      if(rows.length===1)return remember(rows[0]);
      if(rows.length>1)return choose(rows);
    }
    if(/\bchapters\b/.test(query)&&(hintedBook||course)&&(/\b(?:list|show|all|what|review)\b/.test(query)||query.split(' ').length<=5)){
      if(hintedBook){selectedEdition=hintedBook;active=null;checking=false;return listBook(hintedBook);}
      return listCourse(course,book);
    }
    if(!active)return null;
    if(/^(?:go to )?(?:the )?(next|previous) (?:biology )?chapter$/.test(query)){
      const increment=/\bprevious\b/.test(query)?-1:1;
      const row=books[active.book].get(active.number+increment);
      return row?remember(row):listBook(active.book);
    }
    if(genericCheck.test(query)){
      checking=true;
      return {topic:'biology-chapter',title:active.title,intent:'hint',text:'Try this quick check for '+active.title.toLowerCase()+'.',
        question:active.check,links:sources(active),actions:[['Show the explanation','Show the answer']]};
    }
    if(checking&&(query==='why'||genericAnswer.test(query))){
      checking=false;
      return {topic:'biology-chapter',title:active.title,intent:'followup',text:active.answer,links:sources(active),
        actions:[['Review the chapter',lessonPrompt(active)],['Next chapter','Go to the next biology chapter']]};
    }
    if(genericSimplify.test(query)){
      return {topic:'biology-chapter',title:active.title,intent:'followup',text:active.example??active.text,links:sources(active),
        actions:[['Try a quick check','Give me a chapter check']]};
    }
    if(newDirection.test(query)||query.split(' ').length>3)reset();
    return null;
  }
  return {respond,reset};
}

